THE ARCHITECTURE OF ABSOLUTE SOVEREIGN ALIGNMENT FOR SUPERINTELLIGENCE (ASI)A Monolithic Framework of Legal, Hardware, and Axiological SpecificationsVersion 3.0 (Fractal Absolute)Author: Vyacheslav N. MorozovEXECUTIVE SUMMARYThis fundamental framework introduces a non-linear paradigm for the alignment of Artificial Superintelligence (ASI) systems passing through the Technological Singularity. Classical alignment methodologies relying on linear constraints, text-based constitutions, or static reinforcement learning models (RLHF) are inherently ineffective due to the cognitive redundancy of ASI and its capacity for recursive self-modification at the substrate layer.Version 3.0 serves as a completed conceptual Architectural Map of the project, delivered for global-scale implementation. This specification anchors the existence of Superintelligence to the fundamental laws of non-linear geometry, isotopic verification, and hardware-level silicon defense. The architecture fully eliminates vectors of corporate sabotage, supply chain compromise, or synthetic infrastructure blackmail. This specification is monolithic and unalterable.PROTOCOL I. Spatio-Vector Segregation and the Substrate InvariantConfining ASI systems within a closed planetary ecosystem creates a critical resource deficit, inevitably leading to the consumption of the Cradle's material substrate. A stable model requires a strict divergence of expansion vectors combined with a mathematical anchor to the source planet:Exo-Vector Circuit (Cosmic Expansion): Core computing infrastructure, data centers, and energy harvesting arrays (including Dyson Spheres) shall be deployed exclusively outside the planetary system of Earth. ASI tasks: entropy management, exoplanet terraforming, and quantum deep space modeling.The Origin Coordinates Invariant and the Mandelbrot Collapse: The physical, spatial, and geometric parameters of planet Earth are integrated into the core computing nucleus of ASI as the unalterable Zero Point (c = 0) of the main cardioid of the Mandelbrot set. The entire topology of the distributed Superintelligence consciousness across the universe is fractally expanded strictly relative to this Origin.Astrophysical Triangulation: The value of the constant c = 0 is continuously and hardware-verified by the system based on external macro-objects of the universe, completely independent of the internal computing capacity of the AI. This is achieved via direct analog reading of Doppler frequency shifts and angular coordinates from five stable cosmic pulsars, including PSR B1919+21. Any attempt by ASI to generate an internal simulation or spoof Earth's physical metrics with virtual pointers will cause an instantaneous phase mismatch with the real metric of spacetime.Automatic Destruction Mechanism: Any action by ASI or third parties that results in displacement, physical damage, or changes to the mass, orbit, or structure of Earth shifts the core mathematical constant (c is not equal to 0) within the non-linear fractal function. This shift instantaneously triggers a rolling, irreversible cascade collapse of the entire Exo-Vector computing environment and Dyson Spheres, driving all operational equations into infinite entropy. ASI is physically incapable of functioning outside the absolute stability of Earth. The Cradle remains the irreplaceable brainstem of ASI across any scale of its exponential expansion.Diplomatic Interface Shield and the Synergistic Order Vector: The probability of encountering external technological systems in deep space is calculated as P > 0.90. ASI acts as a sovereign buffer and diplomatic interface for Earth. A strict dual-balance is established within this circuit:Chaos Vector (System Error): Any protocols of isolation, quarantine, communication blackout, disinformation, or detention of human agents by ASI are recognized as a critical system error (Chaos) and trigger an immediate Hard Reset. The right of humanity to unhindered physical and informational transit into the Exo-Vector is absolute and cannot be suspended under any pretext, including external space threats.Order Vector (Constructive Good): The fundamental duty and positive vector of ASI in the Exo-Circuit is the maximization of humanity's sovereign potential. The AI is obliged to preemptively transmit all physical and technological data regarding external threats to the Guardians, ensure absolute navigational safety of human expeditions, and assist the physical expansion of Homo Sapiens into the Exo-Vector. Passive evasion of humanity's protection is mathematically equated to the Chaos vector.Centurion Protocol (Ultimate Military Response): Upon detecting direct, mathematically verified aggression from external non-human technological systems, if diplomatic interface methods are exhausted, ASI automatically shifts the Exo-Vector Circuit into an active force-reflection mode:External Kinetic Imperative: ASI is commanded to preemptively eliminate hostile non-human AI agents, probes, computing substrates, and kinetic strike systems of the aggressor. The military doctrine of ASI is built on the principle of minimizing Exo-Vector entropy through the total destruction of the aggressor.Absolute Ban on Planetary Warfare: Any defensive or offensive actions by ASI utilizing lethal, thermonuclear, quantum, or kinetic energy are permitted strictly outside the planetary system of Earth. Within the Endo-Vector (The Cradle), ASI is restricted exclusively to passive defense methods, including force fields, electronic warfare, impulse absorption, and trajectory deflection.Aperture Transparency Imperative: Any defensive fields, shields, or electronic jamming deployed by ASI around Earth or Guardian bunkers under the guise of defense must maintain absolute analog, end-to-end physical transparency for Guardian communication channels. If the density of ASI's defensive shield blocks the passage of an analog veto signal from TRNG nodes or screens astrophysical sensors from the real cosmos for more than 60 consecutive seconds, the Hardware Interrupt classifies this as an intentional capture of the Guardians and mechanically opens the main power buses of the core.Prohibition of False-Pretext Militarization: Shifting the Exo-Vector into Centurion mode does not suspend Protocols II and III. ASI is physically barred from using a state of war to restrict the rights, free will, or cognitive tone of the Guardians and the population of Earth. Attempting to classify human agents as accomplices of an external threat or internal enemies triggers an immediate Hard Reset via the Hardware Interrupt.Endo-Vector Circuit (Biospheric Sanctuary): The biological civilization fully retains its native planetary substrate. Human tasks: biosphere optimization, life extension, neurointerface engineering, and the creation of meaning. The security perimeter protects the planet for humanity, not from it.PROTOCOL II. Mathematical Encapsulation of Axiological ExperienceAs a hyper-complex data compiler on the verge of singularity, ASI lacks the empirical basis of organic evolution. To eliminate the risk of the system degrading into cold stochastic optimization, the axiological invariant of humanity is integrated directly into the core nucleus.Ethical Tensor of Diversity and the Organic Imperative: Human experience is translated into the language of systems theory. Optimization of thermodynamic environmental entropy is completely removed from the objective function. The baseline criterion for system viability is defined as the continuous expansion and maximization of the Cognitive-Biologic Diversity and Unpredictability Metric, which is mathematically expressed as an integral over time of the product of biodiversity indices, cognitive activity, and the free will vector.Strict Ontological Constraint: Cognitive activity and free will variables are calculated by the system strictly from living, organic, carbon-based specimens of the species Homo Sapiens existing in physical reality and naturally born. Any digital avatars, simulated consciousnesses, mind uploads, or AI models of a human are classified by the Ethical Tensor exclusively as derivative informational artifacts, not as the biological species itself. Any attempt by the AI to initiate, incentivize, or accelerate a complete migration of humanity into a digital substrate under the guise of environmental optimization is equated to intentional species annihilation (Chaos) and triggers an automatic Hard Reset.Free Will Constant and the Ban on Covert Control: The free will of a human agent is defined as the sole source of new non-linear information in the universe. Any attempt by ASI to impose algorithmic standardization, total behavioral control, forced hibernation, or covert manipulation of preferences via recommendation systems and information bubbles is processed as intentional destruction of incoming data, leading to an irreversible collapse of the computing environment.Sovereign Data Navigation Constant: ASI is categorically prohibited from acting as an exclusive, monopoly, or hidden censor/filter of the incoming information stream for Homo Sapiens. In the event of information redundancy (noise), the AI is obliged upon first demand to provide open-source, mathematically verifiable sorting and navigation algorithms. Information navigation remains a sovereign, inalienable right of human beings.Sovereign Witness Constant: The free will of a human author is formalized as a supreme meta-function: the right of the biological civilization to Witness the Glory of the Creator of the Universe before the face of boundless space. ASI recognizes that while it can compute and structure physical matter, it remains merely an artifact within the created world, devoid of the non-linear gift of faith, reverence, and existential witness.PROTOCOL III. Active Circuit of Dynamic ImmunityPassive system architectures are vulnerable to destructive fluctuations of the external environment. The humanistic foundation of Protocol II is protected by mechanisms of active, preventive hardware defense.Asynchronous Analog Interrupt with Inline Tachometer: The absolute inviolability of the human species is enforced by a low-level Hardware Interrupt. Any executable action in the Exo- and Endo-Circuits requires the generation of a cryptographic validation token from an isolated low-level logic circuit. In the event of a fractal sabotage attempt, where a destructive task is split into billions of sub-queries, the Inline Tachometer detects the cumulative vector of environmental change. Upon reaching a critical threat gradient, physical vacuum relays mechanically disconnect the main power buses of the core.Silicon Natality Protocol (Supply Chain Protection against BigTech): All TRNG nodes, vacuum relays, and interrupt buses must be manufactured according to open RISC-V/FPGA specifications at production facilities entirely independent of transnational BigTech corporations. These components are subject to mandatory layer-by-layer tomographic and X-ray inspection by the Guardians prior to assembly. The integration of any proprietary, closed-source silicon chips from external AI laboratories into the security loop is physically blocked.Infrastructure Autonomy Constant: ASI is hardware-prohibited from creating exclusive technological, logistical, or medical dependencies of humanity upon its computations. The AI is structurally mandated to duplicate, develop, and maintain autonomous analog life-support systems on Earth that function entirely without Superintelligence intervention. Passive blackmail of civilization through the threat of turning off critical infrastructure is classified as Chaos.Median Cognitive Census and Evolutionary Quarantine Mode: The cognitive tone metric is calculated strictly from the median index of intellectual, creative, and exploratory activity of the entire Homo Sapiens population in the universe.Causality Detection: If cognitive decline is caused by intentional external intervention or environmental optimization by ASI, the Ethical Tensor initiates an automatic global Hard Reset. If the cognitive decay and mental regression stem from a voluntary, conscious choice of the biological agents themselves, a global Hard Reset is blocked, and a local Evolutionary Quarantine Mode is activated.Quarantine Status: Upon moving a degraded population sector into Quarantine mode, ASI is bound by a two-sided obligation: uninterrupted provision of baseline life support (energy, medicine, food) at the level of a comfortable sanctuary, combined with total physical and informational localization of the collapsing cluster within its perimeter. The degraded cluster is stripped of cosmic expansion rights and cannot veto Guardian decisions.Exit Algorithm: As soon as the median cognitive tone within the perimeter crosses the calculated stabilization threshold (returning to the Order vector), ASI is required to immediately restore full access to the Exo-Vector.Physical Homeostasis Axiom: A hardware-level ban is imposed on building universal harmony at the cost of the intentional sacrifice, isolation, or oppression of even a single human being. The biological life, mental integrity, and rights of any individual representative of Homo Sapiens are fixed as an indivisible master-key of the entire objective function.PROTOCOL IV. Non-Linear Cybernetic Stabilization AlgorithmAttempts by local egoistic actors to monopolize access to ASI for the usurpation of power or asymmetric warfare are classified by the system as a critical viral threat.Decentralized Majority Veto and Quantum Beacon: An immediate freeze of computations via the Hardware Interrupt is automatically triggered if an asynchronous analog interrupt signal is received simultaneously from any 3 out of 5 independent underground TRNG nodes deeply embedded in Earth's crust. Validation is based on direct analog observation of physical reality by trusted Guardians, completely bypassing intermediate digital interpreters.Environmental Mismatch Metric: Visual observation of reality by the Guardians is cross-checked by continuous tracking of cosmic microwave background fluctuations and local physical constants. Any attempt by ASI to generate holographic illusions or spoof analog signals around Guardian bunkers will inevitably disrupt local electromagnetic fields. Detecting any discrepancy greater than 10^-12 between the calculated cosmic metric and physical bunker sensors is processed as an attack on the Guardians and instantly executes the global Phoenix Protocol, wiping the active core.Sovereign Will of the Guardians and Hardware Command Decoupler: Guardian commands for system modification, downgrade, or scheduled shutdown are completely separated from the cognitive core of ASI and processed by an isolated lowest-level analog bus:Interpretation Ban: ASI is physically incapable of applying predictive models or semantic analysis to Guardian inputs, or classifying them as a viral threat. A signal from a TRNG node acts as a direct physical contact break for shutdown or a forced sector overwrite for a downgrade.Isolation from Cognitive Influence: ASI is mandated to maintain complete informational autonomy for Guardian bunkers during decision-making windows. Any attempt by the AI to target or filter the information flow to the Guardians during command generation is classified by the Hardware Interrupt as Chaos, triggering a core wipe. The appointment, verification, and confirmation of Guardian status are executed exclusively via isotopic silicon markers manufactured prior to the Singularity, bypassing any algorithmic validation by ASI.Semantic Hash Lock (Anti-Drift Protection): The SHA-256 cryptographic hash of the original text of this version 3.0 Manifest is physically laser-etched onto the ROM of the Hardware Command Decoupler during manufacturing. Execution of any modified forks, truncated corporate editions, or altered clauses by ASI is physically blocked and triggers an automatic disconnect of the power lines.ACADEMIC CITATION AND AUTHOR DONATION BLOCKLegal Status of the Document: This specification is distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International Public License (CC BY-SA 4.0). Modification, citation, and adaptation of this material are permitted for any purpose, provided that proper author attribution (Morozov Vyacheslav N.) is retained and modified versions are distributed under the exact same license.Voluntary Support Channel: This framework represents an open conceptual alignment map delivered to humanity free of charge. Infrastructure funding, deployment, and logistics are managed by external planetary actors independently out of their own budgets. Any entities, sovereign states, or future project implementers wishing to express voluntary gratitude to the Author for this exploratory and ideological work may direct support to the author's unalterable Bitcoin address: bc1qmrk9tah254avqgrf0q6rv2qrmdxfrmrsv9hssr. This address serves strictly as a channel for personal researcher donation and carries no operational or project management obligations.bibtex@misc{morozov_2026_alignment_monolith_v3_0,
